
% Can't Stop The Feeling

a: I | vi | IV | vi |
In: I | vi | IV | vi |
DCh: I | vi | IV | vi |
outro: I | vi | IV | vi |
Vr: $a*2
Ch: $a*2
PostCh: $a*2
b: bVII | . . . I |
c: bVI | . . . bVII | iv | bVII |
PCh: $b*2 $c
drop: R |
bridge: $a*2 $drop
S: [C] $In $Vr $Vr $PCh $Ch $DCh $Vr $Vr $PCh $Ch $DCh*2 $bridge $Ch $PostCh $outro
